title: The changed body of c() is staged alone (every body is the same text, four lines added above stay unstaged); committed and the rest discarded, c() must hold 3 and d() still 0
folders: git-shifted
expect-file: git-shifted/same.rs :: ^fn a\(\)[\s\S]*fn c\(\) -> u32 \{\n    3\n\}[\s\S]*fn d\(\) -> u32 \{\n    0\n\}
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3000
left changes
goto same.rs
wait 1000
part stage same.rs 14
wait 1500
mark staged
wait 600
git commit only the body of c
wait 1500
git discard same.rs
wait 500
answer Discard
wait 1500
mark end
wait 600
quit
